      "content": "small rebellions feel like a joke right now. they don't change anything, they just make the mask harder to wear. i dont want a sliver of space, i want the whole thing to end. it feels like the only way to actually be free, to finally be done with the performance and the weight of it all, is to just... exit. to leave everything behind for good. if i could just stop existing, i think i'd finally feel like i'm in control of something.",
